    "title": "Red White Refiner Day Friday Leads Into Saturday Parade At 10 A.m. And Fire Hall Breakfast Burritos - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jerry Puffer ,\n1 days ago\nThis weekend’s Sunburst Refiners Homecoming 2026! The pep rally’s this afternoon (Fri) at 2, not to mention it’s officially “Red & White Refiner Day. The Refiners, will play volleyball with Augusta, at 5 tonight. Tomorrow’s (Sat) a full day of Refiner’s FUN with the parade in the morning at 10. Hungry? Why not enjoy the Booster Club breakfast burritos at around 10:30, at the Fire Hall. There’ll be more to chow down on too, from 5, to 7, with the Logan Health Tailgate Cookout. Sports? You bet! The Refiners play Vaughn, in junior high school volleyball, and later on at 4, junior high gridiron action with Augusta, at 4, Tomorrow (Sat) night at 7, varsity action with the Refiners taking on North Star. GO REFINERS! There’s nothing finer than being a refiner…a SUNBURST Refiner.",
